<figure id="S4.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span><span id="S4.T3.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Performance comparison on the OpenLLM leaderboard.</span> The default data size is 54888. The fine-tuning base model is Llama-3.1-8B. Best and second-best results on average are highlighted in <span id="S4.T3.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">bold red</span> and <span id="S4.T3.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold black</span>, respectively. Performance changes of <span id="S4.T3.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ENTP</span> with respect to the LQ Set across all benchmarks are also reported.</figcaption>
