            <span id="alg1.l27.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> Full Representative Corpora Set, <math id="alg1.l27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐑</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{R}</annotation></semantics></math>

