<figure id="A5.T9" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span><span id="A5.T9.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Performance comparison among the Vanilla Base Model, LQ Set, HQ Set, Full Set, and datasets mixing the entire HQ Set with various proportions of the ENTP <span id="A5.T9.6.1" class="ltx_text">-</span>generated Inter-Cluster Fusion samples.</span> The fine-tuning base model is Llama-3.1-8B. Best and second-best results on average are highlighted in <span id="A5.T9.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">bold red</span> and <span id="A5.T9.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold black</span>, respectively. The average performance changes of <span id="A5.T9.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ENTP</span>, relative to the HQ Set, are also reported.</figcaption>
