<figure id="A5.T12" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 12: </span><span id="A5.T12.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Performance comparison among the Vanilla Base Model, LQ Set, HQ Set, Full Set, and datasets mixing the entire HQ Set with various proportions of the ENTP <span id="A5.T12.5.1" class="ltx_text">-</span>generated samples from both Inter-Cluster and Intra-Cluster Fusion.</span> The fine-tuning base models are Mistral-7B-v0.3, Llama-3.1-8B, and Qwen2.5-7B. Best and second-best results on average are highlighted in <span id="A5.T12.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">bold red</span> and <span id="A5.T12.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold black</span>, respectively.</figcaption>
